  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This agreement covers the research portefolie on development financed by the Ministry of foreign affairs through the Norwegian Research Council. Details about projects financed by the Research Council are available ontheir website: https://prosjektbanken.forskningsradet.no/en

In previous years the funding was channeled to spesific research programme mentioned below:

RSA-16/0005 Sanocean
QZA-17/0434 CHINOR
IND-15/0007 INDNOR
QZA-16/0178 NORGLOBAL2
RAS-19/0004 UTENRIKS - Asia in a Time of Change 
Global health research
UKR-17/0017 Capacitybuilding Ukranian Research Institutions</narrative>
  </description>
